	/// MicroStrategy metric SQM (LY). MicroStrategy base metric: sum of fact 'SQM' = mt_ge_sqm on tr_oc_yyyymm. MicroStrategy transformation: joins tr_oc_yyyymm.id_tm_yyyymm to lu_tm_yyyymm.id_tm_yyyymm_ly, rebuilt as the periods in 'Dim Year Month'[id_tm_yyyymm_ly] of the periods in context.
	measure 'SQM (LY)' =
